        "@value": "Have the task of transferring the forces generated by their own weight, traffic loads and braking and wind forces to the substructure and abutments. A Bearing must be designed in such a way that it allows movements and rotations due to traffic, temperature differences, earthquakes, prestressing, shrinkage and creep, etc."
